    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63888" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοπ-άω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοπός</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>let the bark peel off</i>,
			of trees which lose their bark on the return of the sap in spring,
				<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.5.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.1.1
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of
			fig-trees, <i>rot at the root</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
